Incorporated source
-------------------

The build uses the source areas recorded in wasm/vital/UPSTREAM.json:

- src/common
- src/common/wavetable
- src/synthesis
- src/unity_build

It also compiles these JUCE modules from Vital's third_party/JUCE checkout:

- juce_audio_basics
- juce_audio_formats
- juce_core
- juce_data_structures
- juce_dsp
- juce_events

Local modifications
-------------------

The following patches are applied reproducibly to the pinned checkout. The
modified source was prepared for WebMCP Synth Creator on 2026-08-31.

- wasm/vital/patches/0001-juce-emscripten-platform-guards.patch
  Guards JUCE's unsupported Emscripten floating-point status-register operations
  and Linux prctl/ptrace headers.
- wasm/vital/patches/0002-juce-disable-backtraces.patch
  Disables JUCE's unavailable native execinfo/backtrace path under Emscripten.
- wasm/vital/patches/0003-juce-wasm-linux-fallbacks.patch
  Supplies the en-US locale fallback and disables unsupported POSIX file-limit
  and native thread-name operations under Emscripten.
- wasm/vital/patches/0004-vital-skip-installed-check.patch
  Prevents the browser build from probing a desktop Vital data directory.
- wasm/vital/patches/0005-vital-optional-wavetable-render.patch
  Adds an optional wavetable-render argument while preserving the original
  one-argument behavior, allowing the bridge to render frames incrementally.

The WebAssembly C API, incremental state-load coordinator, build definitions,
and browser host are Synth Creator integration code in wasm/vital/ and
src/audio/vital/. They do not edit vendor/vital/ in place.

Corresponding source
--------------------

This repository is the source distribution for the combined work. It contains
the Synth Creator source, build scripts, exact patch set, and machine-readable
upstream record. To reconstruct the modified Vital source and WebAssembly
artifact from a fresh clone, run:

  bash wasm/vital/fetch-source.sh
  bash wasm/vital/build.sh

See wasm/vital/README.md for the pinned toolchain and complete prerequisites.
